---
const stats = [
  { value: '2025', label: 'Founded' },
  { value: '50k', label: 'Images processed' },
  { value: '3', label: 'Founding members' },
];
---

<section class="rf-feature">
  <div class="rf-feature-body">
    <div class="rf-feature-text">
      <div class="rf-feature-header">
        <img
          class="rf-feature-logo"
          src="https://realityfoundation.eu/logo.png"
          width="40"
          height="40"
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
        />
        <p class="rf-feature-name">RealityFoundation</p>
      </div>

      <p class="rf-feature-desc">
        RealityFoundation is a tech nonprofit building the infrastructure to certify and verify
        the origin of digital content. As AI makes it effortless to produce convincing images,
        video, and documents, knowing what is real has become one of the defining challenges of
        our era.
      </p>

      <dl class="rf-feature-stats">
        {
          stats.map((stat) => (
            <div>
              <dd>{stat.value}</dd>
              <dt>{stat.label}</dt>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>

      <a
        class="rf-feature-cta"
        href="https://realityfoundation.eu"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        Visit realityfoundation.eu →
      </a>
    </div>

    <figure class="rf-feature-figure">
      <img
        class="rf-feature-image"
        src="https://realityfoundation.eu/Iran_war_AIfake.png"
        width="1282"
        height="700"
        alt="Side-by-side comparison of a real photograph and an AI-generated image purporting to document the same event"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
      />
      <figcaption class="rf-feature-caption">
        After the outbreak of the 2026 Iran war, entirely AI-generated images and videos of
        airstrikes circulated online, depicting events that never actually occurred —
        <a
          href="https://www.ft.com/content/0badb6c5-bce2-4948-9d3b-164bdb55ecf4?syn-25a6b1a6=1"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          source: Financial Times
        </a>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
